      "text": "E4  PREPARE PEOPLE AND WALLETS\nTeller user (Role Agent) auto-creates the\nagent; one active Cash + one active Bank\nAccount wallet, same currency; other\napprovers; fund the vault if it is short\nOut: the branch's only active agent",
