      "text": "NOTE  CURRENT RELEASE\nThe inspected code registers no verified\nstatement profile. Until E3 ships: E4-E6\ncan be prepared (binding without a\nprofile), uploads remain private evidence,\nand E8 stays blocked by gate G3.",
      "fontSize": 18,
